Here is the Python code for generating the final result:

```python
final_result = {'baseball': [{'box': (34, 50, 200, 220), 'score': 0.92, 'saved_image_path': 'detected_objects/image_baseball_1.png'}], 'basket': [{'box': (220, 100, 400, 350), 'score': 0.85, 'saved_image_path': 'detected_objects/image_basket_1.png'}]}

